# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL LIBRARY DATA — never commit.
#
# These are generated by the importers from David's own media PC: game and
# movie titles, box art, posters, and play history. They are personal data
# (and hundreds of MB of images), not source. Anyone cloning this repo runs
# the importers against their own machine to generate their own.
